WEBVTT

1
00:58:54.506 --> 00:58:56.506
And let us take from the cup together.

2
00:58:57.506 --> 00:58:59.506
Can we lift the cup up?

3
00:59:01.506 --> 00:59:05.506
Can we thank the Lord for His blood that He has poured out?

4
00:59:06.506 --> 00:59:08.506
Lord, we raise the cup.

5
00:59:10.506 --> 00:59:12.506
And we remember the blood that was shed.

6
00:59:16.506 --> 00:59:19.506
Lord, thank You for Your blood that has been poured out for us.

7
00:59:19.506 --> 00:59:21.506
That is the sign of the new covenant.

8
00:59:24.506 --> 00:59:25.506
That we are in it.

9
00:59:29.506 --> 00:59:30.506
And where we live daily.

10
00:59:33.506 --> 00:59:34.506
And we will not forget You.

11
00:59:36.506 --> 00:59:37.506
We will worship You.

12
00:59:39.506 --> 00:59:41.506
And we will lead a life that is worthy of Your name.

13
00:59:45.506 --> 00:59:46.506
That is what we read.

14
00:59:46.506 --> 00:59:47.506
Live worthy.

15
00:59:48.506 --> 00:59:50.506
Live a life that is worthy of His name.

16
00:59:53.506 --> 00:59:55.506
Lord, we want to live worthy of Your name.

17
00:59:59.506 --> 01:00:01.506
Let us take the cup of the blood.

18
01:00:17.506 --> 01:00:19.506
Lord, thank You for all the benefits of the covenant.

19
01:00:22.506 --> 01:00:24.506
You have paid for our healing.

20
01:00:26.506 --> 01:00:27.506
In spirit, soul, and body.

21
01:00:29.506 --> 01:00:30.506
You have paid for us.

22
01:00:32.506 --> 01:00:33.506
Healing in our body.

23
01:00:35.506 --> 01:00:36.506
Healing in our thinking.

24
01:00:38.506 --> 01:00:39.506
Healing in our soul.

25
01:00:42.506 --> 01:00:44.506
Thank You that You have paid the price for us.

26
01:00:46.506 --> 01:00:47.506
To live free.

27
01:00:49.506 --> 01:00:50.506
Free and truly free.

28
01:00:52.506 --> 01:00:53.506
And we are free.

29
01:00:55.506 --> 01:00:56.506
Shall we say that this morning?

30
01:00:57.506 --> 01:00:58.506
I am free.

31
01:01:00.506 --> 01:01:02.506
And I will live in that freedom.

32
01:01:04.506 --> 01:01:05.506
I am free.

33
01:01:08.506 --> 01:01:09.506
For what Jesus has done for me.

34
01:01:12.506 --> 01:01:13.506
And I will live in freedom.

35
01:01:17.506 --> 01:01:20.506
I will walk in the freedom that He has purchased for me.

36
01:01:23.506 --> 01:01:25.506
Let's give the Lord a round of applause this morning.

37
01:01:39.506 --> 01:01:40.506
Let's see.

38
01:01:41.506 --> 01:01:43.506
Yes, I am leashed, but I will make it.

39
01:01:43.506 --> 01:01:44.506
Hallelujah.

40
01:01:45.506 --> 01:01:46.506
God is so good.

41
01:01:47.506 --> 01:01:49.506
And He loves us so incredibly much.

42
01:01:52.506 --> 01:01:55.506
And He wants us to grow and flourish.

43
01:01:57.506 --> 01:02:00.506
And that is why we occasionally need encouragement from His Word.

44
01:02:01.506 --> 01:02:02.506
I want to do that today.

45
01:02:03.506 --> 01:02:04.506
A faith encouragement.

46
01:02:05.506 --> 01:02:06.506
For us as a church.

47
01:02:07.506 --> 01:02:09.506
I have a text from John 4.

48
01:02:09.506 --> 01:02:11.506
And there Jesus goes to a Samaritan woman.

49
01:02:12.506 --> 01:02:15.506
The Samaritans were a different people than the Jews.

50
01:02:16.506 --> 01:02:17.506
And Jesus was a Jew.

51
01:02:18.506 --> 01:02:22.506
The Samaritans were actually not a pleasant people at all for the Jews.

52
01:02:23.506 --> 01:02:24.506
They considered them a bit of a surrogate.

53
01:02:25.506 --> 01:02:27.506
Jews who were actually just not Jews.

54
01:02:28.506 --> 01:02:29.506
And they really didn't like that at all.

55
01:02:30.506 --> 01:02:35.506
So in the past, a king Omri, the father of Ahab, for those who might know him.

56
01:02:36.506 --> 01:02:37.506
He bought a mountain.

57
01:02:37.506 --> 01:02:38.506
It was one big idolatry.

58
01:02:39.506 --> 01:02:43.506
And when they had been driven out of the land.

59
01:02:44.506 --> 01:02:45.506
There was also a lot of mixing.

60
01:02:46.506 --> 01:02:50.506
And it was all not what the Jews looked up to.

61
01:02:51.506 --> 01:02:53.506
But Jesus went there.

62
01:02:54.506 --> 01:02:55.506
Jesus went there.

63
01:02:56.506 --> 01:02:57.506
And he went there.

64
01:02:58.506 --> 01:02:59.506
He even went to a woman.

65
01:03:00.506 --> 01:03:01.506
That was actually not the intention for the Jews at all.

66
01:03:02.506 --> 01:03:03.506
That you would just talk to a woman.

67
01:03:03.506 --> 01:03:04.506
But Jesus went to her.

68
01:03:05.506 --> 01:03:07.506
And he said to her,

69
01:03:08.506 --> 01:03:09.506
If you knew what God wants to give.

70
01:03:10.506 --> 01:03:14.506
And who it is that asks you for water.

71
01:03:15.506 --> 01:03:16.506
For Jesus asked that woman for water.

72
01:03:17.506 --> 01:03:19.506
If you knew who it was.

73
01:03:20.506 --> 01:03:22.506
Then you would ask him for it.

74
01:03:23.506 --> 01:03:24.506
And he would give you living water.

75
01:03:25.506 --> 01:03:27.506
And then comes the reaction of that woman.

76
01:03:28.506 --> 01:03:29.506
Then he says, but Lord.

77
01:03:30.506 --> 01:03:31.506
Says that woman.

78
01:03:31.506 --> 01:03:33.506
You have no bucket and the well is deep.

79
01:03:34.506 --> 01:03:36.506
How do you want to draw living water?

80
01:03:38.506 --> 01:03:40.506
And so you could also think as a human.

81
01:03:41.506 --> 01:03:42.506
If you do not know Jesus.

82
01:03:43.506 --> 01:03:45.506
And if you do not know who he is.

83
01:03:46.506 --> 01:03:48.506
Then you could very quickly react like this.

84
01:03:49.506 --> 01:03:51.506
I would probably react differently.

85
01:03:52.506 --> 01:03:53.506
But still in the same line.

86
01:03:54.506 --> 01:03:57.506
And if we, if God asks something of us.

87
01:03:57.506 --> 01:03:59.506
To do something special.

88
01:04:00.506 --> 01:04:02.506
Then we can also react humanly.

89
01:04:03.506 --> 01:04:05.506
That can also be about finances.

90
01:04:06.506 --> 01:04:08.506
For example, if we look at the building plans we have.

91
01:04:09.506 --> 01:04:10.506
For the church.

92
01:04:11.506 --> 01:04:12.506
Then you could react the same way.

93
01:04:13.506 --> 01:04:14.506
But Lord, you do not have a piggy bank.

94
01:04:15.506 --> 01:04:16.506
And the gap in the budget is deep.

95
01:04:17.506 --> 01:04:18.506
Where do you want to get all the money from?

96
01:04:19.506 --> 01:04:21.506
I am of course exaggerating a bit.

97
01:04:22.506 --> 01:04:23.506
But it is indeed a human reaction.

98
01:04:24.506 --> 01:04:25.506
And what is it about?

99
01:04:25.506 --> 01:04:26.506
It is about.

100
01:04:27.506 --> 01:04:29.506
How do we view Jesus?

101
01:04:30.506 --> 01:04:31.506
For what does Jesus say?

102
01:04:32.506 --> 01:04:34.506
If you knew what God wants to give.

103
01:04:35.506 --> 01:04:36.506
He says that to us today.

104
01:04:37.506 --> 01:04:39.506
If you knew what God wants to give us.

105
01:04:40.506 --> 01:04:41.506
And if we only knew.

106
01:04:42.506 --> 01:04:43.506
Who He is.

107
01:04:44.506 --> 01:04:46.506
Who asks you for this impossible thing.

108
01:04:47.506 --> 01:04:48.506
Then you would ask Him for it.

109
01:04:49.506 --> 01:04:51.506
And then He would give it to you.

110
01:04:51.506 --> 01:04:54.506
We face tasks in this world that God wants to give us.

111
01:04:56.506 --> 01:05:00.506
And we are often impressed by the plans that God has.

112
01:05:01.506 --> 01:05:02.506
And His ideals.

113
01:05:03.506 --> 01:05:05.506
But in daily life, they seem completely unfeasible.

114
01:05:06.506 --> 01:05:08.506
How can we ever do this?

115
01:05:09.506 --> 01:05:10.506
But.

116
01:05:11.506 --> 01:05:13.506
Jesus is a God of wonders.

117
01:05:14.506 --> 01:05:16.506
And we need Him.

118
01:05:17.506 --> 01:05:19.506
And if we want wonders.

119
01:05:19.506 --> 01:05:22.506
And if we want wonders, we really need Jesus.

120
01:05:24.506 --> 01:05:26.506
But Jesus also needs us.

121
01:05:27.506 --> 01:05:29.506
He has given us faith, obedience, prayer.

122
01:05:30.506 --> 01:05:31.506
And He needs our actions.

123
01:05:32.506 --> 01:05:33.506
All of them.

124
01:05:34.506 --> 01:05:37.506
And He says that everything is possible for those who believe.

125
01:05:38.506 --> 01:05:39.506
I do not believe in my faith.

126
01:05:40.506 --> 01:05:41.506
I do not believe in my Christian faith.

127
01:05:42.506 --> 01:05:44.506
I do not believe in a Christian world.

128
01:05:45.506 --> 01:05:46.506
As it is sometimes talked about.

129
01:05:47.506 --> 01:05:48.506
But I believe in Jesus.

130
01:05:49.506 --> 01:05:51.506
I cannot trust people.

131
01:05:52.506 --> 01:05:53.506
I disappoint myself.

132
01:05:54.506 --> 01:05:55.506
Let alone when we are together.

133
01:05:56.506 --> 01:05:58.506
I mean, we are not perfect.

134
01:05:59.506 --> 01:06:00.506
Far from it.

135
01:06:01.506 --> 01:06:02.506
But Jesus is.

136
01:06:03.506 --> 01:06:04.506
And when you doubt.

137
01:06:05.506 --> 01:06:06.506
Or when you look at it.

138
01:06:07.506 --> 01:06:08.506
Like how? What are we going to do again?

139
01:06:09.506 --> 01:06:10.506
Pastor Tim said it just last week.

140
01:06:11.506 --> 01:06:12.506
Bring your doubts to Jesus.

141
01:06:13.506 --> 01:06:14.506
And Jesus.

142
01:06:15.506 --> 01:06:16.506
If he can give us living water.

143
01:06:17.506 --> 01:06:18.506
By which we can live.

144
01:06:19.506 --> 01:06:20.506
And we can grow.

145
01:06:21.506 --> 01:06:25.506
Yes, then such a building project is actually of secondary importance.

146
01:06:26.506 --> 01:06:27.506
It is actually.

147
01:06:28.506 --> 01:06:29.506
Yes.

148
01:06:30.506 --> 01:06:31.506
If he can provide for this.

149
01:06:32.506 --> 01:06:33.506
Would he not?

150
01:06:34.506 --> 01:06:36.506
Do you understand? He has done it before.

151
01:06:37.506 --> 01:06:38.506
The fact that we are sitting here.

152
01:06:39.506 --> 01:06:40.506
In a building of our own.

153
01:06:41.506 --> 01:06:42.506
That we are here together.

154
01:06:43.506 --> 01:06:45.506
To his glory that we have worship here.

155
01:06:46.506 --> 01:06:48.506
That we have just thought of him.

156
01:06:51.506 --> 01:06:53.506
And I want to call us as encouragement.

157
01:06:54.506 --> 01:06:55.506
Let Jesus rise up in us.

158
01:06:56.506 --> 01:06:58.506
Let Jesus rise up in you and me.

159
01:06:59.506 --> 01:07:01.506
And let him inspire us.

160
01:07:02.506 --> 01:07:05.506
And let him inspire us to ask him.

161
01:07:06.506 --> 01:07:07.506
But also to go and do.

162
01:07:08.506 --> 01:07:11.506
We can do much more than we often pray or realize.

163
01:07:12.506 --> 01:07:13.506
Why? Because he lives in us.

164
01:07:13.506 --> 01:07:14.506
And let him rise up in us.

165
01:07:15.506 --> 01:07:16.506
That is the question of this morning.

166
01:07:17.506 --> 01:07:20.506
And what happened there after he was with that woman.

167
01:07:21.506 --> 01:07:23.506
The whole crowd there at that village comes to repentance.

168
01:07:24.506 --> 01:07:26.506
Why? Because he has shown that he is the prophet.

169
01:07:27.506 --> 01:07:28.506
And he has also shown it to us.

170
01:07:29.506 --> 01:07:31.506
And I simply believe what God wants to do.

171
01:07:32.506 --> 01:07:33.506
That goes far beyond our understanding.

172
01:07:34.506 --> 01:07:37.506
And he wants to ask impossible things from us.

173
01:07:38.506 --> 01:07:41.506
Why? Because then he also receives all the honor and glory.

174
01:07:41.506 --> 01:07:42.506
We may work hard for it.

175
01:07:43.506 --> 01:07:44.506
We may be actively engaged in it.

176
01:07:45.506 --> 01:07:46.506
We may pray for it.

177
01:07:47.506 --> 01:07:48.506
But he deserves all the honor.

178
01:07:49.506 --> 01:07:50.506
And what is it all about then?

179
01:07:51.506 --> 01:07:52.506
What is his intention with this?

180
01:07:53.506 --> 01:07:54.506
He gives us impossibilities.

181
01:07:55.506 --> 01:07:56.506
And then we just have to get on with it.

182
01:07:57.506 --> 01:07:58.506
No, He has a higher plan.

183
01:07:59.506 --> 01:08:01.506
What does He want? He wants us to grow together in faith.

184
01:08:02.506 --> 01:08:05.506
He wants us to become strong together as a church.

185
01:08:06.506 --> 01:08:07.506
He wants us to become like Him.

186
01:08:07.506 --> 01:08:11.506
He wants His life to flow through us like that living water.

187
01:08:12.506 --> 01:08:16.506
And that growing together in faith is the building of the church.

188
01:08:17.506 --> 01:08:21.506
So this is a part of that growing together in faith.

189
01:08:22.506 --> 01:08:24.506
And this morning I want to encourage us with that.

190
01:08:25.506 --> 01:08:27.506
And perhaps it is also nice to thank Him for doing that.

191
01:08:28.506 --> 01:08:29.506
Maybe it's nice to stand for a moment.

192
01:08:30.506 --> 01:08:32.506
To give Him the honor that is due to Him.

193
01:08:33.506 --> 01:08:34.506
Father, thank You very much.

194
01:08:34.506 --> 01:08:35.506
You are building Your house.

195
01:08:36.506 --> 01:08:37.506
You are building Your house.

196
01:08:38.506 --> 01:08:39.506
We can do all sorts of things.

197
01:08:40.506 --> 01:08:41.506
We can come up with all sorts of ideas.

198
01:08:42.506 --> 01:08:48.506
But everything we need, even plans, even dreams, even vision or whatever.

199
01:08:49.506 --> 01:08:50.506
We need it all from You.

200
01:08:51.506 --> 01:08:55.506
And I pray in the name of Jesus that He gives us new dreams, new plans.

201
01:08:56.506 --> 01:09:01.506
That we will do and undertake the things you have in store for us.

202
01:09:01.506 --> 01:09:02.506
Lord, let us walk in your will.

203
01:09:03.506 --> 01:09:04.506
Lord, let us go.

204
01:09:05.506 --> 01:09:06.506
Let us grow in faith.

205
01:09:07.506 --> 01:09:08.506
Let us grow shoulder to shoulder.

206
01:09:09.506 --> 01:09:10.506
Lord, going into the impossible with you.

207
01:09:11.506 --> 01:09:13.506
Lord, I do not want to pray or talk enthusiastically about us.

208
01:09:14.506 --> 01:09:16.506
But I do want to be enthusiastic about Jesus.

209
01:09:17.506 --> 01:09:19.506
For I know that you do this and that you can do this.

210
01:09:20.506 --> 01:09:22.506
Lord, and I pray for all of us like this.

211
01:09:23.506 --> 01:09:26.506
As we bring this back, even today, that we honor you with it.

212
01:09:27.506 --> 01:09:29.506
And I pray for that, Lord, in the name of King Jesus.

213
01:09:29.506 --> 01:09:30.506
In the name of King Jesus.

214
01:09:31.506 --> 01:09:33.506
And I bless us all with that in the name of King Jesus.

215
01:09:34.506 --> 01:09:37.506
Today there is a collection that is really for the church.

216
01:09:38.506 --> 01:09:42.506
If you want to make an extra or different gift for the building fund, you may do so.

217
01:09:43.506 --> 01:09:45.506
You can do that. It can be done via the app, it can also be done via the bank.

218
01:09:46.506 --> 01:09:47.506
But please indicate that it is for the building.

219
01:09:48.506 --> 01:09:51.506
But I really want to bless you with the gift that you may give.

220
01:09:52.506 --> 01:09:53.506
And the gifts that you may give.

221
01:09:54.506 --> 01:09:55.506
And I believe that God provides.

222
01:09:56.506 --> 01:09:58.506
I believe that He does it through us.

223
01:09:59.506 --> 01:10:00.506
He believes in us.

224
01:10:01.506 --> 01:10:03.506
And I want to bless us with that in the name of Jesus.

225
01:10:14.506 --> 01:10:15.506
Good morning everyone.

226
01:10:18.506 --> 01:10:19.506
Great to see you all.

227
01:10:21.506 --> 01:10:22.506
Very nice to see you all.

228
01:10:24.506 --> 01:10:25.506
Keep coming to the church of Jesus.

229
01:10:27.506 --> 01:10:28.506
You need Him.

230
01:10:29.506 --> 01:10:33.506
You need God urgently every day.

231
01:10:34.506 --> 01:10:38.506
And sometimes, sometimes we have a wonderful Easter service and a baptism service.

232
01:10:39.506 --> 01:10:42.506
And then afterwards, the week after, the church is half full.

233
01:10:43.506 --> 01:10:44.506
And that saddens me.

234
01:10:45.506 --> 01:10:47.506
Because God is not a God of hype.

235
01:10:48.506 --> 01:10:51.506
And one Sunday I'm there because it's Easter.

236
01:10:52.506 --> 01:10:54.506
And the Sunday after I'm no longer there.

237
01:10:55.506 --> 01:11:00.506
To all the people who were baptized last week, I want to say, keep coming.

238
01:11:01.506 --> 01:11:03.506
Because you need God. Every day again.

239
01:11:04.506 --> 01:11:07.506
And if you are not here, then maybe you are watching on the camera.

240
01:11:08.506 --> 01:11:11.506
Look, there are different reasons why you might not be able to come every Sunday.

241
01:11:12.506 --> 01:11:13.506
Some people have to work, shift work.

242
01:11:14.506 --> 01:11:16.506
Some people have divided families due to divorce.

243
01:11:17.506 --> 01:11:20.506
And one week they are with dad, the other week they are with mom.

244
01:11:20.506 --> 01:11:24.506
I understand all the dynamics of our society in which we live.

245
01:11:25.506 --> 01:11:31.506
But if there is one reason that you would not come to church because of boredom or because I don't feel like it.

246
01:11:32.506 --> 01:11:33.506
That is a bad reason.

247
01:11:34.506 --> 01:11:35.506
Jesus was willing to die on a cross for you.

248
01:11:36.506 --> 01:11:37.506
Right?

249
01:11:38.506 --> 01:11:39.506
Let's go for Jesus. Amen.

250
01:11:40.506 --> 01:11:41.506
Let's really go for it.

251
01:11:42.506 --> 01:11:43.506
I just felt like it.

252
01:11:44.506 --> 01:11:45.506
Let's really go for it.

253
01:11:48.506 --> 01:11:49.506
Hallelujah.

254
01:11:50.506 --> 01:11:51.506
Can we close our eyes?

255
01:11:53.506 --> 01:11:55.506
Jesus, I love you.

256
01:11:56.506 --> 01:11:59.506
Jesus, we love you.

257
01:12:00.506 --> 01:12:02.506
Can you say this softly to yourself?

258
01:12:03.506 --> 01:12:04.506
Jesus, I love you.

259
01:12:05.506 --> 01:12:06.506
Jesus, I love you.

260
01:12:07.506 --> 01:12:12.506
Lord, I pray that this Word that I speak today may be a blessing.

261
01:12:13.506 --> 01:12:18.506
That it may deeply take root in the hearts of the people, so that it will not be lost anymore.

262
01:12:18.506 --> 01:12:20.506
That it may become a life lesson.

263
01:12:21.506 --> 01:12:23.506
That we may engage with it in our soul.

264
01:12:24.506 --> 01:12:25.506
And that we will never forget it.

265
01:12:26.506 --> 01:12:28.506
And that we will do something with it in our faith.

