1253
02:13:55.506 --> 02:14:01.506
But faith speaks in a completely different way free from guilt.

1254
02:14:01.506 --> 02:14:04.506
You do not have to search far for it.

1255
02:14:04.506 --> 02:14:08.506
You do not have to ascend to heaven to bring Christ down.

1256
02:14:08.506 --> 02:14:15.506
You do not have to descend into the abyss to bring Christ up from there.

1257
02:14:15.506 --> 02:14:16.506
Here he comes.

1258
02:14:16.506 --> 02:14:22.506
No, you are justified by the word that is very near you.

1259
02:14:22.506 --> 02:14:26.506
Namely, in your mouth and in your heart.

1260
02:14:26.506 --> 02:14:31.506
That is the word of faith that we proclaim to the people.

1261
02:14:31.506 --> 02:14:33.506
And here he comes.

1262
02:14:33.506 --> 02:14:38.506
For if you say out loud with your mouth that Jesus is Lord...

1263
02:14:38.506 --> 02:14:44.506
and believe in your heart that God raised him from the dead and made him alive...

1264
02:14:44.506 --> 02:14:47.506
you are saved.

1265
02:14:47.506 --> 02:14:53.506
By believing this in your heart, you are acquitted of guilt.

1266
02:14:53.506 --> 02:14:59.506
And by saying it out loud with your mouth, you are saved.

1267
02:14:59.506 --> 02:15:02.506
Lord, I pray for everyone in this room.

1268
02:15:02.506 --> 02:15:08.506
Lord, that we will openly admit that we need Jesus Christ.

1269
02:15:08.506 --> 02:15:10.506
He is our savior.

1270
02:15:10.506 --> 02:15:13.506
He is our Lord.

1271
02:15:13.506 --> 02:15:16.506
Holy Spirit, lastly I want to ask you.

1272
02:15:16.506 --> 02:15:20.506
Give Open Church, everyone in Open Church, from young to old.

1273
02:15:20.506 --> 02:15:28.506
Give us the strength through the Holy Spirit to learn to be obedient to the reign of Jesus.

1274
02:15:28.506 --> 02:15:30.506
To the legislation of Jesus.

1275
02:15:30.506 --> 02:15:32.506
To the provision of Jesus.

1276
02:15:32.506 --> 02:15:35.506
That what He says is yes and amen.

1277
02:15:35.506 --> 02:15:37.506
And that we will bow our knees before Him.

1278
02:15:37.506 --> 02:15:41.506
Help us Father that when we are weak in our flesh.

1279
02:15:41.506 --> 02:15:44.506
Help us through the Holy Spirit to become strong.

1280
02:15:44.506 --> 02:15:47.506
To continue following Jesus as Lord.

1281
02:15:47.506 --> 02:15:50.506
In Jesus' name. Amen.

1282
02:15:50.506 --> 02:15:51.506
Amen.

1283
02:15:51.506 --> 02:15:52.506
Amen.

1284
02:16:00.506 --> 02:16:02.506
The service is over.

1285
02:16:02.506 --> 02:16:09.506
Perhaps I will receive new drawings from the architect this week.

1286
02:16:09.506 --> 02:16:11.506
The final drawings.

1287
02:16:11.506 --> 02:16:16.506
Next week I want to discuss and show those drawings to you.

1288
02:16:16.506 --> 02:16:20.506
It is always great to involve the whole church in this.

1289
02:16:20.506 --> 02:16:26.506
And next week we will also have a dedicated collection again for the building.

1290
02:16:26.506 --> 02:16:29.506
And I just want to mention this to you at the end of the service.

1291
02:16:29.506 --> 02:16:32.506
Keep this in your thoughts and live with it.

1292
02:16:32.506 --> 02:16:39.506
Please pray that we can save together for the new building in generosity.

1293
02:16:39.506 --> 02:16:45.506
For I believe in little or no debt and as much savings as possible in the name of Jesus.

1294
02:16:45.506 --> 02:16:46.506
Amen.

1295
02:16:46.506 --> 02:16:47.506
Shall we close our eyes.

1296
02:16:47.506 --> 02:16:49.506
Father in heaven, I thank you for this service.

1297
02:16:49.506 --> 02:16:53.506
Lord, I want to ask you to take these words home for everyone.

1298
02:16:53.506 --> 02:16:58.506
So that it continues to bubble in our spirit, soul, and mind.

1299
02:16:58.506 --> 02:17:02.506
And that we will acknowledge Jesus Christ as Lord of our lives.

1300
02:17:02.506 --> 02:17:05.506
And I bless this week in the mighty name of Jesus.

1301
02:17:05.506 --> 02:17:06.506
Amen.

1302
02:17:06.506 --> 02:17:07.506
Bye bye.
